meta {
  name: Photos
  seq: 7
}

docs {
  Upload a photo for {{restaurant}}'s first dish (firstDishId, set by List
  dishes), as its owner. The body is the image itself; the API sniffs the
  type, re-encodes it as JPEG (dropping EXIF/GPS) and returns its URL, size
  and two placeholders: a ThumbHash and a tiny PNG data URL.

  Photos are served without login, at unguessable URLs, so <img> tags work.
}
